# Gradle (invariants)

**Full detail (section headers, catalog examples, ProGuard):** [reference/gradle.md](reference/gradle.md)

## Must follow

- Root `build.gradle.kts`: plugins `apply false` only; module order: plugins → `android` → `dependencies`
- Dependencies: project modules first, then libraries under comment section headers (Android Core, Lifecycle, Firebase, Koin, Testing, …)
- Version catalog: `[versions]` / `[plugins]` / `[libraries]`; version keys camelCase; library/plugin aliases kebab-case; **never** hardcode `group:artifact:version` in modules
- Add/update deps at **latest stable**; keep AGP/Kotlin compatible; update via `[versions]` only
- SDK defaults: minSdk 24; target/compile latest adopted; Java 17; Kotlin official style
- Scopes: prefer `implementation`; View Binding on — never Data Binding; app release minify on
- Secrets/signing: `local.properties` / CI — never hardcode keystore passwords
- ProGuard keeps for domain entities + presentation state/intent/effect/model (+ ads entities when present)

Read [reference/gradle.md](reference/gradle.md) when editing Gradle or the catalog.
